{
  "about": "Refactor 17, Stage B: the public files of the area integrations (the lines of contracts in scripts/layers.json) are the workspace package @purin-labs/area-integrations-contract in areas/integrations/contract, the contract of the area. The owner decided on 2026-11-24 that a contract imports only the foundation, outside packages and the contract of another area, and scripts/check-layers.mjs holds that rule. scripts/refactor-17/move-module.mjs reads this plan. moduleFrom: the public files of areas/integrations that another area imports, and the public files that they import, belong to the plan, and --sync-plan adds each one; stays names each other public file, which stays public in the area (the scope that the owner approved on 2026-11-24). files: a Worker file goes to server/ and a Portal file to ui/, with its sub-path below server/ or ui/ of the area, less a folder contract/ (sourcePrefixes; movedFolders names each public folder that moves whole under another last name). package: the exports map gives each .ts file of server/ and of ui/, each style sheet of ui/, and each .tsx file, which another module imports; the dependencies are the packages that the files import. package.typeCheck false: the files read Env keys that the Actor files of the Worker merge, as the area package does; the Worker program and the Portal program check each file. edits: the source roots of the lints read the folders of the package.",
